Yes, just provide a showProgress function, this is the default:

this.showProgress = function(el, show) {

      var RECALC_CLASS = 'recalculating';

      if (show)

        $(el).addClass(RECALC_CLASS);

      else

        $(el).removeClass(RECALC_CLASS);

    };

So the "show" parameter is a boolean that indicates whether you should be showing or hiding the progress display.

